  "summary": "A diesel generator set (genset) is a complete power plant on a skid: a diesel engine (compression ignition — fuel is injected into hot compressed air and ignites by itself) drives an alternator through a flywheel. Radiator, fuel tank in the base frame, exhaust silencer and a controller make it self-contained for prime, continuous or standby (emergency) power.",
